===Congress===
The [[National Unity of Hope]] (UNE) made huge gains in the election, gaining 20 seats. The [[Patriotic Party (Guatemala)|Patriotic Party]] (PP), which ran independent of the [[Grand National Alliance (Guatemala)|Grand National Alliance]] (GANA), won 29 seat, while GANA won 37 seats.

